      <title>大风和沙尘暴迫使北京取消数百架航班</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/en/news/thp/2025-04-12/high-winds-and-sandstorms-prompt-beijing-to-cancel-hundreds-of-flights-and-close-parks</link>
      <description><![CDATA[北京（AP）＆mdash;周六大风和沙尘暴的威胁促使北京取消了数百架航班和关闭的公园，因为大型大风砍伐了数百棵树木，破碎的汽车并破坏了中国首都的旧房屋。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/en/news/thp/2025-04-12/high-winds-and-sandstorms-prompt-beijing-to-cancel-hundreds-of-flights-and-close-parks</guid>
